  speakerName: "PH\xD3 L\xDD"
  title: "X\xE2y d\u1EF1ng & n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p"
  content: "Khi \u0111\u1EE7 t\xE0i nguy\xEAn, h\xE3y d\u1EF1ng th\xEAm nh\xE0 ho\u1EB7c
    n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p c\xF4ng tr\xECnh c\u0169. L\xE0ng c\xE0ng l\u1EDBn, c\xE0ng
    c\xF3 nhi\u1EC1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, c\xE0ng m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n m\u1ED7i ng\xE0y."
